OL,3,GNEWSAArcher 'nostalgic' about Somerset
OL,4,Abefore death
OL,5,
OL,6,FJeffrey Archer said he was feeling
OL,7,F"wistful and nostalgic" about his
OL,8,Fupbringing in Somerset a week before
OL,9,Fhis death.
OL,11,FThe bestselling author and former
OL,12,Fpolitician, who grew up in
OL,13,FWeston-super-Mare, died on Monday at
OL,14,Fthe age of 86, the day before the
OL,15,Frelease of his latest - and last -
OL,16,Fnovel.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
