OL,3,GNEWSAArcher 'nostalgic' about Somerset
OL,4,Abefore death
OL,5,
OL,6,FBBC Breakfast presenter Jon Kay
OL,7,Finterviewed Archer last week at his
OL,8,Falma mater, Wellington School, in
OL,9,FSomerset. He said Archer had been
OL,10,Freflecting on his "extraordinary life"
OL,11,Fduring their conversation.
OL,13,F"He admitted he was feeling a little
OL,14,Fwistful and nostalgic, reminiscent
OL,15,Fabout Somerset in his later years," Kay
OL,16,Fsaid.
